<title>USA: BancAmerica wins Clovis, Calif., $28 mln TRANs.</title>
<headline>BancAmerica wins Clovis, Calif., $28 mln TRANs.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>BancAmerica said it won $28 million of Clovis Unified School District, Calif., tax and revenue anticipation notes (TRANs).</p>
<p>The coupon was 4 1/4 percent and the net interest cost (NIC) was 3.8459 percent. --U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
